<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="arrange_overlapping_objects">
    <title>Arrange overlapping objects</title>
    <taskbody>
        <context>
            <p>When objects overlap, you can change their order to control which objects appear in
                front of or behind other objects. </p>
            <p>The arrangement options are<simpletable frame="all" relcolwidth="1* 1*"
                    id="simpletable_df4_fjk_wkc">
                    <strow>
                        <stentry>
                            <p><b>Arrangement</b></p>
                        </stentry>
                        <stentry>
                            <p><b>Moves the selected object</b>
                            </p>
                        </stentry>
                    </strow>
                    <strow>
                        <stentry>
                            <p>To Front</p>
                        </stentry>
                        <stentry>
                            <p>to the front of all other objects.</p>
                        </stentry>
                    </strow>
                    <strow>
                        <stentry>
                            <p>To Back</p>
                        </stentry>
                        <stentry>
                            <p>to the back of all other objects.</p>
                        </stentry>
                    </strow>
                    <strow>
                        <stentry>
                            <p>Bring Forward</p>
                        </stentry>
                        <stentry>
                            <p>one level forward in the stacking order.</p>
                        </stentry>
                    </strow>
                    <strow>
                        <stentry>
                            <p>Send Backward</p>
                        </stentry>
                        <stentry>
                            <p>one level backward in the stacking order.</p>
                        </stentry>
                    </strow>
                </simpletable>To arrange objects:</p>
        </context>
        <steps>
            <step>
                <cmd>On the canvas, select the required object.</cmd>
            </step>
            <step>
                <cmd>On the menu bar, click <b>Arrange</b>.</cmd>
            </step>
            <step>
                <cmd>From the submenu, select the required arrangement type. For example: <b>To
                        Back</b>.</cmd>
            </step>
        </steps>
    </taskbody>
</task>
